 "name_zh": "阿尔达比勒市的谢赫萨菲•丁（Sheikh Safi al-Din）圣殿与哈内加(Khānegāh) 建筑群",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "Sheikh Safi al-din Khānegāh and Shrine Ensemble in Ardabil",
